{"title":"Will Trump \"save\" TikTok?","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/will-trump-save-tiktok","date":1737140983000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you continue to wait to see if TikTok is banned.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/c6fd97fb-9b1d-4ef1-a0cd-8b0e0836112f/Screenshot_2025-01-17_at_1.23.17_PM.png?t=1737138207\" /><div><span><p>(A “rapid unscheduled disassembly” of <a href=\"https://x.com/deankolson87/status/1880026759133032662?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">a SpaceX rocket</a>.)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, if you thought the Bluesky migration was big and, also, kind of silly, just wait until you see the <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-rednote-honeymoon-wont-last?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">RedNote migration</a>. No one is sure whether this is <a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91262630/tiktok-refugees-rednote-app-store-reviews-criticize-us-government?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">propaganda working</a> or <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/01/14/tech/rednote-china-popularity-us-tiktok-ban-intl-hnk/index.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">failing</a>, so it’s probably safest to just <a href=\"https://x.com/TaylorLorenz/status/1880038489313673573?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">be a creep and blame Taylor Lorenz</a> for everything somehow. In other transfers of power, President Joe Biden delivered his <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/joe-biden-farewell-address-oval-office-8bc6051c20adc1bc212cdd8be2578624?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">farewell address</a>, where he called for sweeping anti-corruption reforms and warned of the dangers of oligarchy, before <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLfAf8oHrMo&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">driving away in his hot dog car</a>. The White House’s other dubious accomplishments this week include <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/live/2025/01/15/world/israel-hamas-cease-fire-deal-gaza?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">a ceasefire in Gaza</a>, except <a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2025/1/16/live-celebrations-in-gaza-as-israel-hamas-reach-ceasefire-deal?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">not really</a>; and <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/tiktok-ban-trump-executive-order-1e95d9836bf6f8c0c245ed1c3234d968?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">going back on banning TikTok</a>, except <a href=\"https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/24pdf/24-656_ca7d.pdf?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">not really</a>, except maybe really…look, we’ll go into this further behind the paywall.</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/thehorrormaster.bsky.social/post/3lfvtlnegwc2j?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">John Carpenter says goodbye to David Lynch</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/jan/16/i-knew-one-day-id-have-to-watch-powerful-men-burn-the-world-down-i-just-didnt-expect-them-to-be-such-losers?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">“I knew one day I’d have to watch powerful men burn the world down – I just didn’t expect them to be such losers”</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/sandwichlover7/status/1878298281148617006?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">Good </a><i><a href=\"https://x.com/sandwichlover7/status/1878298281148617006?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">Nosferatu</a></i><a href=\"https://x.com/sandwichlover7/status/1878298281148617006?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\"> post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://doompdf.pages.dev/doom.pdf?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">You can play </a><a href=\"https://doompdf.pages.dev/doom.pdf?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\"><i>DOOM</i></a><a href=\"https://doompdf.pages.dev/doom.pdf?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\"> in a PDF</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y8cE5skIvok&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\">What happens if you use Duolingo for 2000 days straight?</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/whomstea/772786245069930496?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=will-trump-save-tiktok\" target=\"_blank\